{"type":"message","id":"bcf0af83","parentId":"860808f7","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:14:30.415Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are performing quantity takeoff for the HHC Bellevue Hospital Ambulance Drop Off project — BATCH 1: Architectural items.\n\n**Project:** /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/\n\n**YOUR ITEMS (from bid_breakdown.json):**\n- 08-01: Metal Doors and Frames (EA)\n- 08-02: Wood Doors (EA)\n- 08-03: Hardware (LS)\n- 08-04: Glass and Glazing (SF)\n- 08-05: Storefront Systems (SF)\n- 09-01: Gypsum Wallboard (SF)\n- 09-02: Ceramic Tile (SF) — actually porcelain tile per finish schedule\n- 09-03: Acoustical Ceiling (SF)\n- 09-04: Resilient Flooring (SF) — actually poured epoxy per finish schedule\n- 09-05: Painting (SF)\n- 09-06: Wall Protection (LF)\n- 12-01: Casework (LF)\n\n**DATA SOURCES — READ THESE FIRST:**\n1. synthesis/door_schedule_complete.json — 9 doors with sizes and types\n2. synthesis/finish_schedule_complete.json — 5 rooms with all finishes and materials\n3. synthesis/mep_coordination_review.json — ceiling height info\n4. drawings/text/ — text layers from drawings for dimensions\n\n**KEY SHEETS TO ANALYZE (use image tool):**\n- drawings/pages/page_008.png (A-101 Construction Plan) — MEASURE ROOM DIMENSIONS from this\n- drawings/pages/page_024.png (A-801 Finish Floor Plan) — room areas and finish boundaries  \n- drawings/pages/page_021.png (A-701 Door Schedule) — door details\n- drawings/pages/page_022.png (A-702 Casework) — casework details\n- drawings/pages/page_019.png (A-400 Interior Elevations) — wall heights and finishes\n\n**METHODOLOGY:**\nFor each item, provide:\n- Quantity with unit\n- How you calculated it (which rooms, dimensions, formulas)\n- Confidence level (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\n- Notes/assumptions\n\n**CRITICAL:** \n- Use the FLOOR PLAN (A-101) to measure room dimensions. Scale should be noted on the drawing.\n- For painting: calculate wall SF = perimeter × ceiling height, minus openings\n- For flooring: calculate from room dimensions on floor plan\n- For ceilings: same area as floor unless noted otherwise\n- For doors: count from door schedule (9 total, but separate HM from AL)\n- WRITE RESULTS IMMEDIATELY to synthesis/takeoff_batch1_architectural.json — do not wait until the end\n\nSave your output to synthesis/takeoff_batch1_architectural.json"}],"timestamp":1770052470414}}
