{"type":"message","id":"ddfb5091","parentId":"1556b4c6","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:16:02.859Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:16","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sheet A-701.00 — Partition Types, Legends, and Door Schedule\n\n**Project:** ED AMBIANCE BAY ADDITION (H+H Bellevue)\n**Architect:** ARRAY Architects\n**Date:** 09/25/25\n**Project No.:** 6629\n\n## Sheet Contents\n\nThis is **not a casework sheet** — it contains:\n\n- **Door Schedule** (ED Addition) with door types, sizes, frame materials, and hardware sets\n- **Frame Elevations Legend** (Types 3, C, D, etc.)\n- **Door Location Diagram**\n- **Door Hardware Notes** and abbreviation legend\n- **Partition Type Legend** (Types A through D, plus Types 7D, 7E, 7F, 7G, 2, 2A, 2B)\n- **Partition Types General Notes** (fire-rated partition requirements, gypsum board, metal stud framing)\n- **Fire/Smoke Partition General Notes**\n- **Light Detail at Skylight** (Detail A5)\n- **GYP Ceiling Transition Detail** (Detail A3)\n\n## Door Schedule Extract (visible entries)\n\n| Mark | Door Name | Size | Material | Frame |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ED-01 | CART ROOM | 3'-0\" × 8'-0\" | — | AL/SM |\n| ED-02 | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | 6' × 8'-0\" | AL | SM |\n| ED-03 | WPRE SECURITY PICKUP | 6' × 8'-0\" | AL | SM |\n| ED-04 | WPRE SECURITY PICKUP | 6' × 2'-0\" | AL | SM |\n| ED-05 through ED-10 | Various ENTRANCE VESTIBULE doors | Various sizes | AL | SM |\n\n## Partition Types\n\n- **Type A** — Exist. 1 Hour Fire Rated Partition\n- **Type B** — Exist. 1 Hour Smoke Barrier\n- **Type C** — Exist. 2 Hour Fire Rated Partition\n- **Type D** — Exist. Partition Modified to BE 1"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_022.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052562854}}
